#
#   Test fixtures whose byte count or bytes are asserted must check out identically on every
#   platform. Without this git translates LF to CRLF on Windows and a 29-byte fixture arrives as
#   30, which is how test/r/data/file.dat failed there. The owning modules carry the same rule,
#   but .gitattributes is repository configuration and is not vendored with the test trees.
#
test/*/data/*.dat binary
test/*/site/**  -text
